    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="d05a25b5-c82e-5eac-9fbc-2149d66d7134" activityNameId="3e4d0095-ac40-55da-9afa-5fd3d3fa56c8" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Biogas, mix, at agricultural co-fermentation, covered</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Biogas, mix, at agricultural co-fermentation, covered
The inventory refers to a covered agricultural biogas plant in Switzerland in the year 2006 with a capacity of 500m3 and a life time of 20 years.;
UUID: 695524cc-cb57-3a31-bef1-08a9b012decc
This process assembles the different processes to produce biogas in a covered agricultural biogas plant
Location: This process refers to the situation in Switzerland for this type of plants.
Technology: To avoid Methane emissions the new plants in Switzerland are covered, to reduce NH3 emissions the digested matter will be spread with a trail hose.
Time period: 20 plants in the year 2006 have been evaluated
Production volume: 12 mio. m3 Biogas 
Sampling: The data are the average of 20 plants in Switzerland to produce electricity according the criteria of "Naturemade" 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_695524cc-cb57-3a31-bef1-08a9b012decc.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
